{"title":"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_5\">Problem 5</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 5\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/a/e2a559986ed5a0ffc5654bd367c29dfc92913c36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" /> has a right angle at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/d/33d1a58506d347b3e195ea0d9709d89477e0520f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin A = \\frac{2}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"74\" height=\"37\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/1/221feab1ccf101efc4ae0a548c4c1aa685c8410e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\tan B$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/1/9e120e27f1ba5f9d2ad7e606c7d898558b4ecace.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\frac{3}{5}\\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ \\frac{\\sqrt 5}{3}\\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ \\frac{2}{\\sqrt 5}\\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ \\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{2}\\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ \\frac{5}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"413\" height=\"45\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/b/6fb300dacfcde1b57ad070409262b1743e0cd966.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"24\" height=\"14\" /> can be seen as \"opposite over hypotenuse\" in a right triangle, we can label the diagram as shown.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/a/17a88c19f38f78c73773241b6eb0ed13fa71886f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] pair A,B,C; C = (0,0); B = (2,0); A = (0,1.7); draw(A--B--C--A); draw(rightanglemark(B,C,A,8)); label(&quot;$A$&quot;,A,W); label(&quot;$B$&quot;,B,SE); label(&quot;$C$&quot;,C,SW); label(&quot;$2x$&quot;,(B+C)/2,S); label(&quot;$3x$&quot;,(A+B)/2,NE); label(&quot;$y$&quot;,(A+C)/2,W); [/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"205\" />\nBy the Pythagorean Theorem, we have:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/6/686ffa510d576731905d732f69ba2b00e324bffd.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[y^2+(2x)^2=(3x)^2\\]\" width=\"143\" height=\"19\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/0/0c069169c6cc689aab68ba5af18ac088b8625ced.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[y=\\sqrt{9x^2-4x^2}\\]\" width=\"125\" height=\"20\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/6/3b64384db2e84286e4b644dbbc9980910d12a6d1.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[y=\\sqrt{5x^2}\\]\" width=\"75\" height=\"21\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/a/8cada19913fbbaf0d998ba591decab85cfbd8154.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[y=x\\sqrt{5}\\]\" width=\"68\" height=\"20\" />\nso <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/4/694b908cb5a2b93e4cc738f4c0ea967a4a7a2baa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\tan{B} = \\frac{x \\sqrt{5}}{2x} = \\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"157\" height=\"41\" />, which is choice <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/3/693c4044f8526a8179956e8ac7a3f2f9d61e2c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"43\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME\" title=\"1983 AHSME\">1983 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1983 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1983\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_